    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_outcity_1",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_loop",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "GreyThroat! What's your position?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, I am providing support to an L. G. D. team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're about to engage!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention all elite operators: this may be our first, last, and only large-scale battle in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone take objective one as your primary mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "My team and I will be focusing on engaging the enemy commander.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you all to remember: top priority is completing the terms of our contract, that is to work with the L. G. D. to ensure the security of Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Rhodes Island's mission in this battle is to reduce the friction between the Infected and uninfected people, to prevent clashes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are Rhodes Island! No matter what else we carry into battle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter when, no matter where!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And of course, if at any point our operations fall outside our standards, we will put a stop to them at once!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As such, we go into battle with a heavy burden of responsibility on our shoulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was for my sake, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's such a worrywart...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "We'd better speed up, or we won't make it.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw what tough customers those Infected were back there. That's a lot for one operator, or even one team to handle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really should've put that kid to bed once and for all back on the rooftop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, copy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't get your butt to the ambush point, I'll take all of last year's disciplinary reports and hand them over to Dr. Kal'tsit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Settle down! I'll be there right on time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya! She's scratching my coat!;......;Could you put me down when you take a call?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "What am I supposed to do? We have to hurry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "(You'll pay for that one!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why so quiet, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't do anything! It's the Doctor who clammed up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell her already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, say something...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Doctor. I forgot you and Blaze would definitely go at it like this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do what I gotta do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you so pleased with yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, all I need is your location and current operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You two seem to be getting along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure are!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wait, what's happening here? What should I tell her?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(I don't know.);(Say nothing.);(I'm not sure.)",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This is bad! Red alert! I'm taking psychic damage! I need guidance!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep at it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "She hung up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no. We're in trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least we're here. Let's take a load off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But this is the highest point in the district?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... shit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what they say, the shortest distance between two points is a straight line. Let's hop down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Hop? From this high?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep. Yawn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on... If I'm not mistaken... That's Mephisto's team over there to the east, moving to the ambush zone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "And over there... the scaly kid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's taking his team to fight something. What is all that black there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that the herd...? With those numbers?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like we can't rest here, Doctor. Let's go. Time for the final battle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Amiya. Hey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm taking the Doctor into the fight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you thinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We let a small Reunion group go, then we track them into the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Weren't you leaving that to the special forces?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No reason we can't take the opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already looked into the situation once and one thing is clear: as long as we're there, the special forces can't act openly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the fighting stops, they won't be able to do much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not worried about orders from the top?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's going to stand up and take responsibility for the team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, so you've got it all figured out. What's going on in the slums?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My informants have been busy. There's a few sectors I haven't been able to contact, but we have a lot more intelligence than anyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a big gamble. But I guess we have no choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The L. G. D. is the only group that can face down the special forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, do you copy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Officer Ch'en, we're in position!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mmhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to apologize for the whole ordeal with Reunion scooping up the Infected. That wouldn't have happened if we'd been more thoughtful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's thanks to the L. G. D.'s quick action in the slums that Lungmen is able to plan against Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "On a strategic level, I think you're fine, Officer Ch'en. But personally...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Officer Ch'en, Misha is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I can't condone your opinions of the Infected. Even you know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Lungmenites who love their city will fight for her, no matter who they are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, what an awesome little bunny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I just hear Miss Swire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mind her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I agree with you, Amiya. Fighting for Lungmen can unite the people... except those tied up with Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But actually living in Lungmen is another matter. Time can't solve everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. We have to solve everything ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wishful thinking. The Infected and uninfected live in different worlds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not wishful thinking, Officer Ch'en. It's thinking about Misha, and the countless other Infected who died just like her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the gap between those two worlds that killed them. Are we going to let that divide define us? Are we not going to fight to bridge it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you can understand, Officer Ch'en, why it is that the Infected and uninfected of Rhodes Island come together to fight for Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're here, Officer Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prepare for battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an ambush! The L. G. D. is pushing us in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Push through to the slums. Even though we haven't heard from Crownslayer... the slums are our only way out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you going to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Me and a few teams have encouraged the 'herd' to gather up here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "They won't attack me, so I can fight alongside them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fire in the hole!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't hold for long!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... Guhhh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's those special Infected! Look out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll bring up the rear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not coming back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm! Mmhhh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let him speak. He can't do his Arts like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?! You can't do this! Come back! Please! Come back here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You once told me you would do anything I asked you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sasha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You said you don't want to make decisions for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just, if you have your own ideas and your own goals now... I can't blame you for your choices.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the way it is, Mephisto... Well, that's great.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm out of options.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "So let me tell you my last wish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sasha...? What are you talking about? I don't understand!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let them escape! Take out their commanders!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Rhodes Island swallow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mouthing 'pull the trigger.')",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hit the deck! Watch the crossfire! We've got them surrounded!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fall back, Rhodes Island crossbowman! This corridor is ours!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Faust! Run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crossbowmen, I know FrostNova is on her way. And even though Crownslayer is missing, her people are out there in the slums somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "When FrostNova gets here, you're under her command.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trust her. Once she arrives, you'll be okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "And with my Originium Arts, you'll be invisible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't, Faust! That will rupture your organs!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't matter. There's no reason not to do it anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Retreat. That's an order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "And take him with you. But not to Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Faust...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't do this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you survive. Even on your own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014That's my last wish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sasha! Sashaaaaa!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to hurt anyone. I don't want to get anyone hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish we had just run away, back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could have... just run away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sasha, you promised! We promised each other! We swore we would survive together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late... for me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm too tired.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sashaaaaaa!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye, Eno.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He nocks a bolt into his crossbow, and winds it."
    },
    {
        "text": "He takes aim, for the last time."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
